OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice block Orange Order from
OL,4,Acontroversial parade route
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey had been unable to make the
OL,7,Fpermitted parade on Sunday morning
OL,8,Fbecause protesters had gathered on the
OL,9,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road. The
OL,10,Fstand-off continued throughout Sunday,
OL,11,Fwith the Orangemen waiting at the
OL,12,Fchurch, around a mile from the road,
OL,13,Ffor the go-ahead from police.
OL,15,FSinn Fein First Minister Michelle
OL,16,FO'Neill joined the protest, prompting
OL,17,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP) leader
OL,18,FGavin Robinson to accuse her of acting
OL,19,Funlawfully.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
